% Repository-owned final-change seam for the pdfTeX 1.40.27 oracle.
%
% This deliberately leaves the canonical banner unchanged.  The separately
% named instrumentation-ready executable proves that a final repository
% change can be applied without editing canonical or generated upstream files.
% The semantic observer is added by the subsequent instrumentation issue.
@x [0] l.311 - repository final-change seam
@d pdftex_version_string=='-1.40.27' {current \pdfTeX\ version}
@y
@d pdftex_version_string=='-1.40.27' {current \pdfTeX\ version}
@z
